{"seq":2,"slug":"communicating-with-shareholders","title":"股东沟通","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/warren-buffett/major-works/communicating-with-shareholders","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-annual-letters","title":"致股东的信","url":"/c/people/warren-buffett/major-works/communicating-with-shareholders/the-annual-letters","wordCount":1345,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-omaha-meeting","title":"奥马哈股东大会","url":"/c/people/warren-buffett/major-works/communicating-with-shareholders/the-omaha-meeting","wordCount":1426,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 股东沟通\n\n巴菲特与股东沟通的方式，本身就是他独特的代表作。本章考察其两大经典形式。\n\n第一篇文档讲述\"致股东的信\"——这些坦诚睿智的信件如何成为全球投资者的经典。第二篇文档讲述\"奥马哈股东大会\",呈现这场\"资本家的伍德斯托克\"盛会的独特魅力。\n"}